msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid "RAUUUGH!!!"
msgstr "으아아아악!!!"

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:601
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid "OUTSIDE OF A CAR"
msgstr "차 밖"

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:602
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid "It's a car. WHAT NOW?"
msgstr "차다. 이제 뭐 하지?"

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:605
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid "Get in."
msgstr "탄다."

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:610
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid "Pick up the car."
msgstr "차를 들어 올린다."

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:614
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid "Nevermind."
msgstr "관둔다."

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:621
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid "Hotwired!"
msgstr "직결 시동 성공!"

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:622
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid "It doesn't take long for "
msgstr "순식간에 "

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:622
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid " to break into the car and get it running. No keys necessary!"
msgstr "이(가) 차에 침입해 시동을 건다. 열쇠는 필요 없다!"

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:631
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid "Let's Roll!"
msgstr "출발!"

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:632
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid ""
"The keys fit perfectly!\r\n"
"\t\t"
msgstr ""
"열쇠가 딱 맞는다!\r\n"
"\t\t"

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:633
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid " unlocks the car door."
msgstr "이(가) 차 문을 연다."

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:635
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid "Get in the car"
msgstr "차에 탄다"

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:636 deathforth/car-logic.df:642
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid "Leave it be for now"
msgstr "일단 그냥 둔다"

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:639
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid "Locked Car"
msgstr "잠긴 차"

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:640
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid ""
"This car looks like it's in really good condition. \r\n"
"\t\tBut where are the keys?"
msgstr ""
"상태가 아주 좋아 보이는 차다. \r\n"
"\t\t그런데 열쇠는 어디 있지?"

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:644
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid " hotwires the car!"
msgstr "이(가) 직결로 시동을 건다!"

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:648
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid "Pick up the car"
msgstr "차를 들어 올린다"

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:654
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid "Car Keys"
msgstr "차 열쇠"

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:655
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid ""
"This is a set of keys, including some car keys.\r\n"
"\t"
msgstr ""
"차 열쇠가 포함된 열쇠 꾸러미다.\r\n"
"\t"

#: deathforth/car-logic.df:656
msgctxt "deathforth/car-logic.df"
msgid " picks it up."
msgstr "이(가) 그것을 줍는다."

